<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= locale %>">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Donations - Museum of the Jewish Soldier in WWII</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styles.css">
  <style>
    .donation-header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    .donation-header h1 { color: #0038b8; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .donation-header p { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem; }

    .donation-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .donation-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      border-top: 5px solid #0038b8;
    }

    .donation-card h3 {
      color: #0038b8;
      margin-top: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .donation-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 15px 0; }
    .donation-card ul li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; }

    .tax-box {
      background: #eef2ff;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border: 1px dashed #0038b8;
    }

    .bitcoin-wallet {
      background: #fdf6e3;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: monospace;
      word-break: break-all;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .paypal-btn {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: #0070ba;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .contact-footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #333;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .contact-footer a { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }
    .paypal-btn {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  background: #ffc439; /* Official PayPal Gold/Yellow */
  color: #003087 !important; /* PayPal Dark Blue for text */
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 10px;
  transition: background 0.3s ease;
  border: 1px solid #e2b331; /* Subtle border for depth */
}

.paypal-btn:hover {
  background: #f2ba36; /* Slightly darker gold on hover */
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="container header-flex">
    <h1><%= __('home.title') %></h1>
    <div class="logo-area"><img src="/images/Outlook-dieerunr.png" alt="Logo"></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="container">
  <section class="donation-header">
    <h1><%= locale === 'he' ? 'תרומות' : 'Donations' %></h1>
    <p><strong>Your contribution to benefit the Museum of the Jewish Soldier in WWII will help us turn this dream into reality.</strong></p>
    <p>Every donation will be accepted with great appreciation. We invite you to become a partner in this historic national mission!</p>
    
    <div class="tax-box" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:20px;">
       <a href="https://www.jwmww2.org/userfiles/file/2025/46.jpg" target="_blank">View Section 46 Tax Exemption Certificate</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="donation-grid">
    <div class="donation-card">
      <h3>🏦 <%= locale === 'he' ? 'העברה בנקאית' : 'Bank Deposit' %></h3>
      <p>Direct deposit to the association account:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Bank:</strong> Hapoalim (12), Branch 656</li>
        <li><strong>Address:</strong> 57 Hanasi Street, Kiryat Ono</li>
        <li><strong>Account Name:</strong> Association for Establishment of the Museum of the Jewish Soldier in WWII</li>
        <li><strong>Account No:</strong> 12-656-66557</li>
        <li><strong>IBAN:</strong> IL44-0126-5600-0000-0066-557</li>
        <li><strong>SWIFT:</strong> POALILIT</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="donation-card">
      <h3>✉️ <%= locale === 'he' ? 'צ׳ק' : 'By Check' %></h3>
      <p>Payable to: <strong>The Association for Establishment of the Museum of the Jewish Soldier in World War II</strong></p>
      <p>Mail to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>P.O.Box 793, Kiron</li>
        <li>Kiryat Ono, 5542106 Israel</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="donation-card">
      <h3>🇺🇸 <%= locale === 'he' ? 'תרומות מארה"ב' : 'US Tax-Exempt (PEF)' %></h3>
      <p>USA tax deductible contributions (min. $25) payable to <strong>P.E.F. Israel Endowment Funds, Inc.</strong></p>
      <div class="tax-box">
        317 Madison Avenue, Suite 607, New York, NY 10017<br>
        <em>* Please include a recommendation that it be used for the Museum of the Jewish Soldier in WWII.</em>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="donation-card">
      <h3>💻 <%= locale === 'he' ? 'דיגיטל' : 'Digital & Crypto' %></h3>
      <p><strong>PayPal:</strong></p>
      <a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=4PAMVNRNRF6ZU" 
   class="paypal-btn" 
   target="_blank" 
   rel="noopener noreferrer">
   <%= locale === 'he' ? 'תרומה באמצעות PayPal' : 'Donate via PayPal' %>
</a>
      
      <p style="margin-top:20px;"><strong>Bitcoin Wallet:</strong></p>
      <div class="bitcoin-wallet">1Peg8ftiJMZnkvxGM7fhHaZQxLxXATXQjd</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-footer">
    <p>For further information, please contact the association's offices:</p>
    <p>📞 03-3730444 | ✉️ <a href="mailto:veteran@jwmww2.com">veteran@jwmww2.com</a></p>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>